<title>USA: Viatel management buys 1.025 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Viatel management buys 1.025 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viatel Inc said on Wednesday four members of its senior management team bought a total of 1.025 million shares of common stock at $9.75 per share.</p>
<p>The transaction was managed by Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
